                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b9d482a7-6772-4601-a742-c735f853f891",
                        "source_entry_id": "0e057625-0b94-3fd9-9791-4062861d21e0",
                        "source_sense_id": "f21527e0-c98b-3792-8232-d4bf16157b0a",
                        "source_sense_description": "Bunker, in dem Raketen stationiert sind und zum Abschuss bereitstehen",
                        "target_lang_word": "silo",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "silo",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fbf850ad-6259-3274-8bdf-5fe395e17eae",
                                        "entry_id": "bb73107b-4a46-3934-88a7-6a894a6eab6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A vertical building, usually cylindrical, used for the production of silage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ffa1d9d8-d32b-375c-82da-1facd79a1a01",
                                        "entry_id": "bb73107b-4a46-3934-88a7-6a894a6eab6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "From the shape, a building used for the storage of grain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "385fa618-b458-3444-a4e6-155a095cfc23",
                                        "entry_id": "bb73107b-4a46-3934-88a7-6a894a6eab6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An underground bunker used to hold missiles which may be launched."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99ffa90d-0303-4119-8418-786cd837197c",
                                                "sense_id": "385fa618-b458-3444-a4e6-155a095cfc23",
                                                "text": "As a rule of thumb, to reliably destroy a hardened missile silo or communications bunker, a one megaton warhead should land within a 600 foot radius of its target. This will ensure that the enemy silo lies within the crater gouged out by the nuclear blast."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a7efd33-abe3-3a0c-85f4-a125866cacb6",
                                        "entry_id": "bb73107b-4a46-3934-88a7-6a894a6eab6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An organizational unit that has poor interaction with other units, negatively affecting overall performance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18251331-ab2e-4f4d-a424-c0c9b0c907e8",
                                                "sense_id": "8a7efd33-abe3-3a0c-85f4-a125866cacb6",
                                                "text": "A silo is created when members in one department or function do not interact with those in another department, even though there might be operational benefits to the interaction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78939be6-554c-4b5d-8478-e9eafd42df66",
                                                "sense_id": "8a7efd33-abe3-3a0c-85f4-a125866cacb6",
                                                "text": "Graeme Bickerdike, a member of campaign organisation The HRE Group, told RAIL: \"This infilling and demolition programme - costing much more than repair - has been conceived with no thought for its impact beyond the silos where distant, unaccountable officials manage their spreadsheets."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa10f058-d471-41e2-b517-21fb96c72987",
                                                "sense_id": "8a7efd33-abe3-3a0c-85f4-a125866cacb6",
                                                "text": "\"And the mindset of a silo of rail engineers, and a silo of highway engineers, and a silo of bus experts, and a silo of active travel people, you're not going to integrate just because you put them in one organisation.\n\"You have to actively look at ways to cross-fertilise that thinking, to get multi-modal projects hard-wired in. And from our view, I see TfW as a behaviour change organisation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2aeefc36-088a-351e-b1fd-93e446da360d",
                                        "entry_id": "bb73107b-4a46-3934-88a7-6a894a6eab6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A structure in the information system that is poorly networked with other structures, with data exchange hampered."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a2a8ece-c47d-43e6-8005-5873dccb017c",
                                                "sense_id": "2aeefc36-088a-351e-b1fd-93e446da360d",
                                                "text": "Our networking is organized in silos, and employees lose time manually transferring data."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3796de62-5887-3544-94dc-39c3abc42ed6",
                                        "entry_id": "bb73107b-4a46-3934-88a7-6a894a6eab6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of like-minded individuals who are not exposed to outside opinions or input."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3c3a37c-bf0e-3229-a7ea-b202b6aacda5",
                                        "entry_id": "bb73107b-4a46-3934-88a7-6a894a6eab6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In Microsoft Windows operating systems, a kernel object for isolating groups of threads."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "silo",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd46a675-6399-320b-943a-ffcc6ab4e464",
                                        "entry_id": "78b565fc-6665-3967-aa99-8877cca3fbc8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To store in a silo."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44ff2b1a-8742-3add-8a75-3f31e3edc002",
                                        "entry_id": "78b565fc-6665-3967-aa99-8877cca3fbc8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To separate; to isolate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92e79bf5-2534-4d52-a38e-d9fb8a57380e",
                                                "sense_id": "44ff2b1a-8742-3add-8a75-3f31e3edc002",
                                                "text": "Then there’s the fact that platforms like TikTok tend to silo users based on interests. Niche communities (insert hobby here plus Tok) are thriving, and so a person who may be famous on FarmTok or BookTok may have trouble breaking out of the mold."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b5769a3-2037-4a11-8131-45b87037cffb",
                                                "sense_id": "44ff2b1a-8742-3add-8a75-3f31e3edc002",
                                                "text": "Sheel Mohnot, a venture capitalist friend of Bi’s who has commissioned twiblings, said the problem is that information is siloed when “each agency has their own database of wombs.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
